  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VPO REDD+ Readiness Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project goal is to make Tanzania REDD+ ready for implementation of Paris Agreement and institutionalize  results-based payments. The project will deliver on the safeguard standards, a broader understanding of emission levels, identifying priority forest carbon sites, and calculating the cost benefit streams to assess what REDD+ would be worth and to whom.</narrative>
  </description>
